c","user":{"login":"OlivierWierda","id":63440497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDQwNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63440497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierWierda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T19:06:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T19:06:01Z","body":"That was indeed the problem, thanks a ton! I think it should be mentioned in the [LOD tutorial ](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/3d/mesh_lod.html ) or [Import config documentation ](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/import_configuration.html ), right? \n\nI would be willing to write a short text explaining it, but I'm not sure how to actually submit it for the released Godot documentation.\n\nPlease feel free to use the image in the OP in the documentation page for a visual example of LOD's corrupting vertex colors.\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981535260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981572087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107621#issuecomment-2981572087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107621","id":2981572087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xty33","user":{"login":"OlivierWierda","id":63440497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDQwNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63440497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierWierda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T19:17:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T19:17:29Z","body":"Suggested Priority Fixes:\n\n🏅 Immediate: Warning dialog when Generate LODs would break vertex colors\n⭐ Short-term: Option to preserve vertex colors during LOD generation\n🌟 Long-term: Advanced LOD generation that intelligently handles all vertex attributes ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981572087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993795313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107621#issuecomment-2993795313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107621","id":2993795313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ycbDx","user":{"login":"OlivierWierda","id":63440497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDQwNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63440497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierWierda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T22:17:40Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T22:17:40Z","body":"I think I found the short term fix! Godot user meshoptimizer to simplify the mesh for the LODs, however it doesn't seem the -sv flag, which tries to preserve vertex colors when decimating is bound/called in Godot. \n\nI tried fixing it myself but the Godot codebase to me looks like:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62e59dba-4df1-43ab-a793-9249b906477f)\nAnd compiling from source to test would take me a year.\n\nAnyone willing to test this?\nhttps://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer/pull/751","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993795313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994508366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107621#issuecomment-2994508366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107621","id":2994508366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yfJJO","user":{"login":"OlivierWierda","id":63440497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDQwNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63440497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierWierda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T23:02:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T23:02:42Z","body":"# Bug: Vertex Colors Corrupted During LOD Generation\n\n**Issue:** Godot 4.4.1 corrupts vertex colors when generating LODs due to incomplete meshoptimizer integration lacking equivalent of gltfpack's `-sv` flag.\n\n**Root Cause:** In `scene/resources/importer_mesh.cpp`, the `generate_lods()` function passes vertex colors to `meshopt_simplifyWithAttributes` but uses incorrect attribute weights compared to gltfpack's `-sv` implementation.\n\n**Analysis:** \n- gltfpack with `-sv` uses different attribute weights and multiplies colors by alpha\n- Reference: `gltf/mesh.cpp` in meshoptimizer repo, `simplifyAttributes()` function\n\n**Current Godot behavior:**\n```cpp\n// scene/resources/importer_mesh.cpp:~line 200\nattrib_weights[0] = attrib_weights[1] = attrib_weights[2] = 1.0f; // Normals\nattrib_weights[3] = attrib_weights[4] = attrib_weights[5] = 1.0f; // Colors\n\n// Colors without alpha multiplication:\nmerged_attribs_ptr[j * attrib_count + 3] = colors_ptr[rj].r;\nmerged_attribs_ptr[j * attrib_count + 4] = colors_ptr[rj].g;\nmerged_attribs_ptr[j * attrib_count + 5] = colors_ptr[rj].b;\n```\n\n**gltfpack `-sv` behavior:**\n```cpp\nattrw[0] = attrw[1] = attrw[2] = 0.5f; // Normals\nattrw[3] = attrw[4] = attrw[5] = 1.0f; // Colors\n\n// Colors with alpha multiplication:\ndata[i * stride + 3] = a[i].f[0] * a[i].f[3]; // R * Alpha\ndata[i * stride + 4] = a[i].f[1] * a[i].f[3]; // G * Alpha  \ndata[i * stride + 5] = a[i].f[2] * a[i].f[3]; // B * Alpha\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n1. Change normal weights from `1.0f` to `0.5f`\n2. Multiply color components by alpha: `colors_ptr[rj].r * colors_ptr[rj].a`\n\nThis matches meshoptimizer's gltfpack `-sv` implementation and preserves vertex colors during LOD generation.\n\n**Files:** `scene/resources/importer_mesh.cpp` (generate_lods function)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994508366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994510801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107621#issuecomment-2994510801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107621","id":2994510801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yfJvR","user":{"login":"OlivierWierda","id":63440497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDQwNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63440497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierWierda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierWierda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T23:07:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T23:07:27Z","body":"@AThousandShips sorry to bother you but could you confirm this is indeed the problem? I found the definition of the \"-sv\" flag in MeshOptimizer and its different from what we currently have. The \"-sv\" flag should fix specifically my issue AFAIK.\n\nThe alpha also being fixed would be a very nice bonus :D","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994510801/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995608751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107621#issuecomment-2995608751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107621","id":2995608751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yjVyv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/